WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.980
You're terrible!

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:07.190
I can't believe you'd do something like this!

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:15.160
"We denounce Mayor Shimazu!"

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:16.870
Move!

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.370
Hey, Arima!

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:22.830
What are you doing?

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.330
This is the only way to 
handle gossip like this.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.460
You're violating their freedom of expression!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:34.370
Anonymous bastards like this
don't get freedom of expression.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:34.470
"We denounce Mayor Shimazu!"

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:38.720
It's a right that belongs to people
who can take responsibility for it.

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:43.430
Actually, the Watergate incident

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:47.310
never would've been discovered if it weren't
for the ability to be anonymous, right?

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:52.070
Want me to give you a personal lesson
in how the sword is mightier than the pen?

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.860
I'll pass, thanks.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.720
Okay, everybody get going.

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:01.870
"We denounce Mayor Shimazu!"

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.500
What's gotten into Arima?

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.540
Is he in love with Shimazu-<i>san</i>?

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:06.370
Maybe he is!

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:10.880
"We denounce Mayor Shimazu!"

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.880
Sheesh... Who did this?

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:43.140
"Sakaimachi City Hall"

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:49.350
"Sakaimachi City Hall"
"Episode 9: The Distance Between Him and Her"

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:47.430
Mayor Shimazu, what do you say
about allegations involving Geotech?

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:48.810
What about the rumors

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:53.110
that you were involved with their
construction permits and land buyouts?

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:50.440
"Sakaimachi City Hall"

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:54.440
No comment.

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.440
Send any questions to my lawyer.

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:06.990
I don't know how she can even come to school.

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.970
She's living a life of luxury
on all that bribe money, right?

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.500
Shimazu-<i>san</i>, don't worry about it.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:22.510
The only person I told about the things
those papers said was Arima-<i>kun</i>.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:26.000
So it was the boss who wrote that?

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.020
Probably.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:33.640
From now on, come to me instead!

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:38.250
Come to me when you have problems. Not him.

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:41.030
Yuki-<i>kun</i>.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.740
Mio, can we talk?

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:48.660
Okay...

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:54.040
You seem to think I put
that stuff up there, but I didn't.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:56.240
Just forget it...

00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:02.250
Everything they said was true.

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:07.050
Everybody's right.
I can't go to this school anymore.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:11.530
Mio...

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.360
Goodbye.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.340
Hey!

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:44.300
Something's bothering you, huh, kiddo?

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.280
Mitsuki-<i>san</i>.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.520
So you couldn't convince
Shimazu-<i>san</i> that it wasn't you?

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:53.440
Yeah.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:55.310
Does that mean I have a chance?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:57.270
I'm being serious here.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.690
Sorry.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:06.240
Did you see anyone standing
around the bulletin board last night?

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.990
No, I didn't.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.120
I see...

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.080
It's so strange.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:16.440
The question is, why put that up
on a school bulletin board?

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:20.560
What was the culprit trying to accomplish?

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.260
Could it have been to get Mio?

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:30.720
She's beautiful, gets good grades,
and she's a teacher pet.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.640
So anybody could be jealous, huh?

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.550
So the next question is, who did it?

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:41.650
The culprit is someone who
has negative feelings towards Mio,

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:44.500
benefits from her leaving the school,

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.780
and has something to do
with Sakaimachi Academy...

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:52.530
Sounds like you're talking about me.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:57.360
She and I are in love
with the same man, after all.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:02.630
I saw the two of you talking
to each other happily last night,

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.940
and I got a little jealous.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:09.320
You wouldn't do anything so cowardly.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:12.050
I know that better than anyone.

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.170
They say love is blind.

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:21.040
I'm sorry. I shouldn't have said that.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.650
Our relationship is over for good.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:31.770
Okay, I need to get going.
Ryuzoji-<i>sensei</i> is waiting.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:33.830
Thanks.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.160
You're a huge help, Mitsuki-<i>san</i>.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.330
You're welcome.

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:38.660
See you later.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:39.510
Yeah.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.220
Where is the mayor?

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:00.100
The master has not yet returned.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.560
Well, when will he be home?

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.740
He's not going to just disappear, he is?

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:08.150
He's always home late.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.080
"Water, Flashlight, Batteries, 
Rope, Shovel, Snacks"

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.710
"Dear Dad"

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:43.970
Yuki!

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:50.340
How are you feeling?

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.040
Much better.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:55.970
Eriko-<i>sensei</i>.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:57.390
Kanna-<i>chan</i>...

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.220
Another fever?

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:02.870
Yeah. I don't know what's causing them,
and I can't do anything to help.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:08.320
Take care.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.480
Thank you.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:17.700
By the way, did you see what
was up on the bulletin board?

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:21.330
Yeah, I took it down.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.040
It was ridiculous.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:24.550
I see.

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:30.420
I heard rumors that you might be
the mysterious anonymous journalist.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:33.330
There's nothing worse than
being the target of a rumor.

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:35.170
For me and Mio.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:40.430
Well, I knew you weren't
the type to do something to do that.

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.870
I'm lucky I've got a teacher
who understands me.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.160
Even if Shimazu-<i>kun</i>
was doing something wrong,

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:48.620
you'd be the type to try and stop her.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.230
Am I wrong?

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.320
That's the right thing to do, right?

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.940
That sounds like what you'd say.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:10:00.160
If the problems with
Mayor Shimazu get any bigger,

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:03.040
Mio really won't be able to come to school.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.720
We're already past that point.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:13.130
"New Development Mayor of Sakaimachi Resigns"

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:10.630
Following an investigation
by the local prosecutor,

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:13.130
Mayor Shimazu just now
announced his resignation.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:16.760
The city council has stated
their intent to withdraw their support

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:17.260
"New Development Mayor of Sakaimachi Resigns"

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.380
for the Geotech construction project,

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.290
and the lightning strikes are...

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:23.890
I just got word.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.710
Mio Shimazu will be transferring.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.110
"Class 3-C Emergency Contact List"

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.030
"Mio Shimazu"

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.130
Hello?

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.040
Takuya-<i>kun</i>?

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.410
Oh, Ayumi-<i>san</i>.

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:49.920
There's been some problems at work.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:52.040
I'll be home late tonight.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.590
Can you get dinner delivered?

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.160
Yeah, got it.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.590
Don't stress yourself out too much.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:01.060
It sounds like things are 
getting really crazy.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.800
Don't worry.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:08.100
"Geotech Construction 
Project to be Shut Down?"

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.850
This time, it's a problem
for the company's executives.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:08.100
There's nothing I can do about it.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.640
I'll just have to wait and see what happens.

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:15.610
The news said there might be some problem
involving the lightning strikes too.

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:17.230
Don't worry about that, either.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:20.570
I spent a lot of time
talking with the families.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:24.000
It's taking time,
but it's going in a good direction.

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:25.480
I see.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:30.880
Anyway, keep an eye on
Mayor Shimazu's daughter, Mio-<i>san</i>.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.840
"Class 3-C Emergency Contact List"

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.260
How did you know about Mio?

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:37.800
She came to our house once, right?

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:41.420
She's so pretty, I remember her well.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:45.840
I thought she might be your girlfriend.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.160
It's not like that.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.030
I mean it.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:56.890
Takuya-<i>kun</i>, do what you
can to help Mio-<i>san</i>, okay?

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.390
Got it.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:11:59.990
Talk to you later!

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:00.650
Yeah.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:07.350
I should talk to her in person, shouldn't I?

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:07.830
"Class 3-C Emergency Contact List"

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:17.390
But I won't be able to just walk in.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:20.400
Hi!

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:22.630
Good to see you again.

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.760
You're a busy lady.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:27.180
Hey, knowing you,

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:30.520
is it possible you already knew
Mayor Shimazu was corrupt?

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:31.560
Maybe.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:35.730
You did know.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:38.320
Come here.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.430
What?

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:42.400
What's happening here is bad news.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.990
It's trouble for your classmate, too.

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:48.870
If you'd told me first,
I could've handled it properly.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:49.950
Boss!

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:53.940
What's wrong?

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:55.960
Come with me, quick!

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.240
Shimazu just...

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:03.550
"For Sale"

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:00.380
She ran away from home?

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:03.370
Yeah. One of her maids just told me.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:06.090
Is Mio-<i>san</i> home?

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:07.400
Um...

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.180
Actually, she's...

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.350
"Dear Dad"

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:17.180
So I don't know what to do...

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:24.780
"For Sale"

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:21.480
She can't have gone far.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:22.730
Let's split up and look for her.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.300
Boss!

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.890
I'll search the area
from the school to the coast.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:32.160
Then I'll go down to Central Street.

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.160
Okay.

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:37.620
"For Sale"

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.620
Let's meet in front of
the school gate in two hours.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:36.920
Got it!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.530
She's not at school, huh?

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:53.460
Takuya?

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.280
What's wrong?

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.940
I see. She ran away, huh?

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:01.870
Yeah.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:04.360
Talk to you later. I'm in a hurry.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.190
Wait.

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:07.400
I'll help you.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.180
Where should I look?

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:13.080
I need to do what I can to help her.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:16.320
She was my student when I was a substitute.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:17.740
Mitsuki-<i>san</i>...

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:22.550
Okay, can you search
the area around Meiunji Park?

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:24.040
Sure.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:27.550
We're supposed to meet up
in front of the school gate in an hour.

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:28.720
Understood.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:29.700
Thanks!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.060
Hey! Mio!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:19.580
Arima-<i>san</i>.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:21.900
Kanna-<i>chan</i>.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:23.900
Have you seen Mio?

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.110
About that...

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:30.040
Shimazu-<i>san</i> went to a place
she shouldn't have gone...

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.340
I told her not to, but...

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.370
Don't tell me she...

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:39.410
It's dangerous...

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.040
Thank you, Kanna-<i>chan</i>.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.140
Huh? Ichijo-<i>san</i>?

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:52.510
I heard what happened from Arima-<i>san</i>.

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:53.430
I see.

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.970
Did you find out where Shimazu-<i>san</i> went?

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:57.190
Well...

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.890
Hey!

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:00.760
Boss?

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.710
I found out where Mio is.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:05.150
Where is she?

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.070
Inside Mt. Sankaku.

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:21.360
Why go inside Mt. Sankaku now?

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:26.170
She probably wanted to go
before she left the country.

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.320
I knew it.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.280
There's a cave here?

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.310
Mio found it.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:47.770
She went inside, alone?

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:49.190
We need to hurry.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.860
This information wasn't made public,

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:56.530
but they'll be hauling some stuff
at the construction site tomorrow morning.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:58.160
Even after the accidents?

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:02.670
We need to find her before then
or the police will get involved.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:06.250
Then there's no time to waste.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.750
Mitsuki-<i>san</i>, you've
examined ruins before, right?

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:10.920
Yeah. A long time ago, though.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:13.970
Okay, you and I will go inside.

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.550
Yuki, you wait out here.

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:20.060
Wait. Takuya-<i>san</i>, let me go!

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.430
Why?

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.930
Somebody needs to stay here
in case something happens!

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:25.550
That's not it!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.600
That's not it...

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.070
It's my fault!

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.440
It's all my fault!

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:36.200
So I have to go!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.620
I see...

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:42.200
So that's it.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:48.630
I was the one who put all those papers up
on the bulletin board this morning.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.630
I was walking in front
of the nurse's office last night,

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:57.900
and I heard you two...

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:02.100
And then... I just went crazy...

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:05.430
I didn't even know what I was doing!

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:10.790
Yuki-<i>kun</i>,

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:13.730
that's called jealousy.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.030
Yuki...

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.310
I can't believe you.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:28.620
I was an idiot...

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:33.170
I thought she was over you...

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:36.200
I thought she might love me instead...

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:41.140
That's why...

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:45.690
I'm so sorry!

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:55.620
Mt. Sankaku has never
been properly investigated.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:58.330
Nobody knows what's inside.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:02.120
We don't even know if Mio's safe.

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:05.030
But...

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:08.330
We're going to find her, no matter what.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:09.540
No matter what!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:12.840
Then you'd damn well
better apologize to her.

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:13.690
Got it?

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:15.300
Okay...

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:20.330
Mitsuki-<i>san</i>, sorry, but can you stay here?

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.120
I'm going with him.

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:25.560
Okay.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:27.020
Really?

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:30.640
You started this. Now help end it.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:33.860
Okay, Takuya-<i>san</i>... No, boss!

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:36.440
Stop calling me "boss" already!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:48.370
Both of you, if you think it's dangerous,
turn back immediately.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:53.290
If you're not back
by morning I'm calling the cops.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.290
Okay.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:19:59.800
Let's go.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:00.490
Right.

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:20.640
The air in here's so damp...

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:26.530
This isn't saltwater.

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:27.870
It's an underground stream.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.950
You're amazing, boss!

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.920
I can tell your dad was an adventurer.

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:34.790
He was a historian.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:38.380
What's that sound?

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.340
It stopped...

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:45.800
Is Shimazu-<i>san</i> okay?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.470
We need to find her fast.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:48.290
Let's hurry.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.160
That looks...

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.640
Like a cage.

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:15.430
Get back.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:17.040
Okay...

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.920
Don't do anything stupid.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.820
I know!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:27.550
I did something stupid!

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.430
Seriously?

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:39.610
A switch created by nature,
a natural mechanism...

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:42.610
A mysterious tower created 
by Mother Nature...

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:44.120
That's impossible!

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:02.630
What is this place?

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:41.530
"Episode 10: Feelings Overlapping"

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:38.750
Episode 10: "Feelings Overlapping."
